Z||000000||Bob||10-11-2001||12:09 AM||||About how much hp can a Getrag handle with an upgraded cluth?  For all you 3800 autos out there, what transmission are you using, and have any of you run into any tranny failures? The reason I ask is that GP GTPs keep trashing 4t65E tranmissions.<P>------------------<BR>1997 Pontiac Grand Prix GTP -lotsa mods, so little room...||||reg||4
Z||000001||ray b||10-11-2001||12:30 AM||||bullet proof??? get a bigger gun!!!<BR>no hot rod is perfect<BR>a buddy's  bonni sse broke 3 times stock tooo<BR>and not a racer hi miler or a nut G M builds some crap, luck of the draw<BR> but fiero is lighter by 1000 lbs that should help<BR>back to the getrag how long it lasts is up to your luck and skill and style, some have never broke with a v-8<BR> blue print built by skilled builder maybe best if you can pay the price for both a auto or stick if real hp is to live long.||||reg||1
